> > 
> >            Summary: poor performance while preprocessing source code
> >            Product: IO/Storage
> 
> Thanks for the report.
> 
> >            Version: 2.5
> >      KernelVersion: 2.6.28.2
> >           Platform: All
> >         OS/Version: Linux
> >               Tree: Mainline
> >             Status: NEW
> >           Severity: normal
> >           Priority: P1
> >          Component: Other
> >         AssignedTo: io_other@kernel-bugs.osdl.org
